@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

## GET /notifications/
### [OK 200] Get all notifications — utilisateur authentifié
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/
Authorization: {{token}}

### [KO 401] Get all notifications — non authentifié
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/

## GET /notifications/{id}
### [OK 200] Get a single notification by ID — utilisateur authentifié
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### [KO 401] Get notification by ID — non authentifié
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1

### [KO 404] Get notification by ID — notification inexistante
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/999999
Authorization: {{token}}

## POST /notifications/{id}/read
### [OK 204] Mark a notification as read — utilisateur authentifié
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1/read
Authorization: {{token}}

### [KO 401] Mark as read — non authentifié
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1/read

### [KO 404] Mark as read — notification inexistante
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/999999/read
Authorization: {{token}}

## POST /notifications/
### [OK 201] Create a notification — champs valides
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "object": "Test notification",
  "message": "This is a test notification message",
  "type": "GENERAL"
}

### [KO 400] Create notification — champs requis absents (object manquant)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "message": "Notification sans objet",
  "type": "GENERAL"
}

### [KO 404] Create notification — userId inexistant
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 999999,
  "object": "Notification pour inconnu",
  "message": "Cet utilisateur n'existe pas",
  "type": "GENERAL"
}

### [OK 201] Create a team invitation notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "object": "Invitation à rejoindre une équipe",
  "message": "Vous avez été invité à rejoindre une équipe",
  "type": "TEAM_INVITATION",
  "membershipId": 1
}